{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47014","headline":"夏云曲 · 齐己","name":"夏云曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红嵯峨，烁晚波，乖龙慵卧旱鬼多。\n爞爞万里压天堑，扬雷电光空闪闪。\n好雨不雨风不风，徒倚穹苍作岩险。\n男巫女觋更走魂，焚香祝天天不闻。\n天若闻，必能使尔爲润泽，洗埃氛，而又变之成五色。\n捧日轮，将以表唐尧虞舜之明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}